{"id":776,"name":"turtonator","speciesId":776,"dex":776,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["fire","dragon"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":78,"defense":135,"special-attack":91,"special-defense":85,"speed":36},"abilities":[{"name":"shell-armor","hidden":false}],"height":20,"weight":2120,"baseExp":170,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/776.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/776.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/776.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/776.ogg","genus":"Blast Turtle Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Tartaruga Explosiva","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"The shell on its back is chemically unstable and explodes violently if struck. The hole in its stomach is its weak point."},{"version":"moon","text":"It gushes fire and poisonous gases from its nostrils. Its dung is an explosive substance and can be put to various uses."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It lives in volcanoes and eats sulfur and other minerals. Materials from the food it eats form the basis of its explosive shell."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its exploding shell poses a real danger but is sensitive to moisture. On rainy days, Turtonator takes silent refuge in caves."},{"version":"sword","text":"Explosive substances coat the shell on its back. Enemies that dare attack it will be blown away by an immense detonation."},{"version":"shield","text":"Eating sulfur in its volcanic habitat is what causes explosive compounds to develop in its shell. Its droppings are also dangerously explosive."}],"flavorPt":"Comer enxofre em seu habitat vulcânico é o que causa o desenvolvimento de compostos explosivos em sua concha. Seus excrementos também são perigosamente explosivos.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":70,"eggGroups":["monster","dragon"],"is